{"id":"wb-4-107","name":"济渎庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"济渎庙","text":"济渎庙位于中国河南省济源市济渎大道1396号，为“四渎”之一济水的水神庙，同时也是济水东源所在，是四渎神庙中现存规模最大，保存最完整的一处。济渎庙始建于隋开皇二年（582年），唐贞元十二年（796年）在济渎池后建北海祠，使其亦为祭祀北海神的场所，故全称济渎北海庙。济渎庙于1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B5%8E%E6%B8%8E%E5%BA%99","revisionId":89023364,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89023364","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0b13cfa096c96fb458c2f314.jpg","title":"20250716_Jidu_Temple_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250716_Jidu_Temple_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e1/20250716_Jidu_Temple_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​济源济渎庙 寝宫（北宋）","width":320,"height":213}}